@startuml workflow_system
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityFontSize 11
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #64748B
skinparam PartitionFontSize 13
skinparam PartitionFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F1F5F9

title ReqAML dynamic workflow — canonical early path\n(composition: WorkflowProfile · Gate · ActionHook · RoleBinding · SubjectKind)

|Client sys-req|
start
:Create **RequirementLine**\n+ version (draft)\n**<color:#64748B>SubjectKind: RequirementLine</color>**;
:Optional **D04** activate\n**<color:#64748B>lifecycle ≠ approve</color>**;

|Approver (RoleBinding)|
:Tree / line **approve** (D12)\n**<color:#64748B>ActionHook → Gate + ApprovalRecord(line)</color>**;
note right
  Pins approved_version_uid
  + statement_hash.
  Slot filled by project/client
  RoleBinding — not hard-coded
  Client admin vs AO.
end note

|Contractor cap|
:Propose **CapabilityLine**\n(+ artifacts)\n**<color:#64748B>SubjectKind: CapabilityLine</color>**;
:Link **Satisfies**\ncap → req version\n**<color:#64748B>EdgeSatisfies (E04)</color>**;

|Approver (RoleBinding)|
:Approve **CapabilityLine**\nas solution\n**<color:#64748B>optional gate: Satisfies → approved req</color>**;

|Planning|
if (Line ApprovalRecord\n**approved**?) then (yes)
  :**D08** set priority\n+ grooming / WI path\n**<color:#64748B>Gate: gate-line-approved</color>**;
else (no)
  :Deny\n**FIX-DENY-PRIORITY-UNAPPROVED**;
  kill
endif

|Succession .N|
if (Mint successor —\nsame statement_hash?) then (yes)
  :Deny **no-op successor**;
  kill
else (new hash)
  :Clear line ApprovalRecord\n**<color:#64748B>effect on ActionHook mint</color>**;
endif

|Release|
if (**cyber_gate** /\nGate cyber-ship on?) then (on)
  :G05 ship after\nSecurity + AO slots\n**<color:#64748B>ARCH-CYBER-GATE as Gate</color>**;
else (off)
  :G05 Release manager ships;
endif
stop

legend left
  |= Component |= Role in engine |
  | WorkflowProfile | Project/client bundle: which gates + hooks |
  | Gate | Predicate + approver slots (line-approved, cyber-ship, noop-block) |
  | ActionHook | action_id → gates_before → effects_after |
  | RoleBinding | Configurable who fills stakeholder / solution / AO slots |
  | SubjectKind | RequirementLine · CapabilityLine · Version · Satisfies · Release · ChangeSet |
  |= Locked |= |
  | Approval vs cap | First-class early; caps often approved as solutions via Satisfies |
  | Grain | ApprovalLine; UI may batch-approve a tree |
  | .N | Clears approval; same-hash mint blocked |
endlegend

@enduml
